MOSS-Image inference port for SSUI

dit.py, vae.py, ops.py:
Adapted from modelscope/DiffSynth-Studio, Apache-2.0,
commit 08fdc0da8f41426885d9432e9007e6e460a4c30d:
  diffsynth/models/moss_image_dit.py
  diffsynth/models/flux2_vae.py
  diffsynth/models/general_modules.py (RMSNorm)
Changes: removed DiffSynth runtime, training/checkpoint wrappers and optimized
attention dependency; use native Torch SDPA; calculate FP64 time sinusoid on CPU
for MPS tensors. The public SSUI loader currently enables CUDA/ROCm and CPU only.

