Text configuration from DiffSynth-Studio's moss_image_text_encoder.py at the
commit above. Changes: standalone text-only forward, no cache or generation,
pure Torch gated delta rule, native SDPA, text-only default RoPE, per-prompt
unpadded inference. No Transformers 5 internals are imported or monkey-patched.

